{
  "id": "E216",
  "title": "Shopping for a Dress",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2018-05-05",
  "synopsis": "Do you prefer shopping alone or with friends?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/728/da244204da5def32c663e60aa5c339a63230e2de.mp3?1525103579",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "这条蓝色的裙子比那条红色的好看\n\n安妮和林红在逛街。\n安妮：林红，这条蓝色的裙子怎么样？\n林红：很漂亮！\n安妮：那条红色的呢？\n林红：我觉得这条蓝色的裙子比那条红色的好看。你可以试一试。\n安妮：好的。你看到喜欢的衣服了吗？\n林红：还没有，我再看看。你先去试衣间吧，我一会儿就过去。\n安妮：行。",
    "traditional": "這條藍色的裙子比那條紅色的好看\n\n安妮和林紅在逛街。\n安妮：林紅，這條藍色的裙子怎麼樣？\n林紅：很漂亮！\n安妮：那條紅色的呢？\n林紅：我覺得這條藍色的裙子比那條紅色的好看。你可以試一試。\n安妮：好的。你看到喜歡的衣服了嗎？\n林紅：還沒有，我再看看。你先去試衣間吧，我一會兒就過去。\n安妮：行。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "This blue dress looks better than the red one."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "安妮和林红在逛街。",
      "traditional": "安妮和林紅在逛街。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī hé lín hóng zài guàng jiē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie and Lin Hong are shopping."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "安妮：林红，这条蓝色的裙子怎么样？",
      "traditional": "安妮：林紅，這條藍色的裙子怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī lín hóng zhè tiáo lán sè de qún zi zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Lin Hong, what do you think of this blue dress?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "林红：很漂亮！",
      "traditional": "林紅：很漂亮！",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng hěn piào liang",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: It’s very pretty!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "安妮：那条红色的呢？",
      "traditional": "安妮：那條紅色的呢？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī nà tiáo hóng sè de ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: What about the red one?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "林红：我觉得这条蓝色的裙子比那条红色的好看。你可以试一试。",
      "traditional": "林紅：我覺得這條藍色的裙子比那條紅色的好看。你可以試一試。",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng wǒ jué de zhè tiáo lán sè de qún zi bǐ nà tiáo hóng sè de hǎo kàn nǐ kě yǐ shì yí shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: I think the blue dress looks better than the red one. You can try it on."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "安妮：好的。你看到喜欢的衣服了吗？",
      "traditional": "安妮：好的。你看到喜歡的衣服了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī hǎo de nǐ kàn dào xǐ huan de yī fu le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Ok. Have you seen any clothes you like?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "林红：还没有，我再看看。你先去试衣间吧，我一会儿就过去。",
      "traditional": "林紅：還沒有，我再看看。你先去試衣間吧，我一會兒就過去。",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng hái méi yǒu wǒ zài kàn kan nǐ xiān qù shì yī jiān ba wǒ yí huì'r jiù guò qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: Not yet. I’ll look around a bit. You can go to the fitting room first, I’ll go there later."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "安妮：行。",
      "traditional": "安妮：行。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī xíng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Ok."
    }
  ],
